        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Modern 4' Center to Center Stainless Steel Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith a 4 foot center to center, this modern stainless steel pull will certainly make a statement. This rectangular pull has a satin stainless steel finish that is easy to take care of, making it the ideal choice for high-traffic areas. It is good for both residential and commercial applications. Choose from mounting kits for use on wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass doors. The Satin Stainless Steel 48 Inch Rectangular Pull is available as a Thru-Bolt Mounted Pull, a Surface Mounted Pull, or Back-to-Back Mounted Pulls (must order 2 pulls). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CAN-18T48FB-spc.gif?v=1704354588\" width=\"600\" height=\"151\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DWD-CAN18T48FB-32D Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/24-inch-rectangular-stainless-steel-pull\"><b>24\" Rectangular Stainless Steel Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/36-inch-rectangular-satin-stainless-steel-pull\"><b>36\" Rectangular Stainless Steel Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/rectangular-60-inch-mitered-stainless-steel-pull\"><b>60\" Rectangular Stainless Steel Pull</b></a>, and \r\n<a href=\"/products/72-inch-satin-stainless-steel-rectangular-door-pull\"><b>72\" Rectangular Stainless Steel Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the 48\" Stainless Steel Rectangular Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: <b>304 Stainless Steel Tubing</b></li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 48\" (1219.2 mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 49\" (1245 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2-5/8\" (66.7 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-5/8\" (92 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Width: 1\" (25.4 mm) x 1-1/2\" (38.1 mm)</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Limited quantities available.</b> <a href=\"/pages/contact\"><b>Contact us</b></a> for more information.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Satin Stainless Steel 48 Inch Rectangular Pull",
                "description": "Satin Stainless Steel 48 Inch Rectangular Pull - With a 4 foot center to center, this modern stainless steel pull will certainly make a statement. This rectangular pull has a satin stainless steel finish that is easy to take care of, making it the ideal choice for high-traffic areas. It is good for both residential and commercial applications. Choose from mounting kits for use on wood, metal, or glass doors. The Satin Stainless Steel 48 Inch Rectangular Pull is available as a Thru-Bolt Mounted Pull, a Surface Mounted Pull, or Back-to-Back Mounted Pulls (must order 2 pulls).",
